1919+ 7BD6 CD 20 6B         call Gfx_DrawCrumblingTile
1920+ 7BD9 D1               pop  de
1921+ 7BDA C1               pop  bc
1922+ 7BDB 18 2B            jr   .next
1923+ 7BDD
1924+ 7BDD              .finish_crumble:
