1951+ 7BFF CD 20 6B         call Gfx_DrawCrumblingTile
1952+ 7C02 D1               pop  de
1953+ 7C03 C1               pop  bc
1954+ 7C04
1955+ 7C04                  ; 3. Decrementa contatore blocchi attivi
1956+ 7C04 21 77 B0         ld   hl, crumbling_active_count
1957+ 7C07 35               dec  (hl)
1958+ 7C08
1959+ 7C08              .next:
