1961+ 7C0A 1C               inc  e
1962+ 7C0B 7B               ld   a, e
1963+ 7C0C FE 20            cp   32
1964+ 7C0E 38 03            jr   c, .col_ok
1965+ 7C10 1E 00            ld   e, 0
1966+ 7C12 14               inc  d
